THE PACKAGE THIS IS A PORT OF

app/index.html contains a JavaScript port of the scalar (Kirchhoff /
thin-element) solver from gratinglab, the Python package at
https://github.com/jamccoy/gratinglab, which is the reference implementation
and the source of truth for every formula here. The port is a derivative
work of that package and its licence follows, retained under clause 1.

